OL,3,GNEWSAGarvaghy Road investigation to
OL,4,Astart next week - Robinson
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the Democratic Unionist
OL,7,FParty (DUP) has said he expects the
OL,8,Fcriminal investigation into the
OL,9,Funlawful blocking of Garvaghy Road to
OL,10,Fbegin next week.
OL,12,FOn Wednesday, the PSNI chief constable
OL,13,Fsaid there would be an investigation
OL,14,Fafter protesters blocked the mainly
OL,15,Fnationalist road to prevent an Orange
OL,16,FOrder parade from happening.
OL,18,FProtesters remain on Garvaghy Road and
OL,19,Fthe Orange Order has maintained a
OL,20,Fpresence at Drumcree church after talks
OL,21,Fto end the parading dispute ended
OL,22,Fwithout agreement.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
